# Read by BuildKit for services/cloud/Dockerfile only. The build needs the
# workspace's manifests and every member crate (cargo resolves the whole
# workspace even to build one), including what hura-core includes from
# hurad/images/ and hurad/policies/; everything else is weight.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!hurad/
!services/cloud/
**/target
